WEEK 15 — DARK MODE AND PRINTING

Date: Monday, 16 November 2026

Problem: In dark mode the barcode and some coloured panels became hard to read, and the printed receipt could come out dark.

Solution:
- Colours are set as tokens, so the dark palette is changed in one place.
- Barcodes always print black bars on white, so scanners can read them in dark mode.
- Printing always uses the light palette, so receipts are correct on paper.
- Added a sun/moon toggle in every header and a System/Light/Dark setting.
- The theme is set before the first paint, so there is no light flash.
